          "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-048-liuhui-complete:p001",
          "quote": "　　劉繪字士章，彭城人，太常悛弟也。父勉，宋末權貴，門多人客，使繪與之共語，應接流暢。勉喜曰：「汝後若束帶立朝，可與賔客言矣。」解褐著作郎，太祖太尉行參軍。太祖見而歎曰：「劉公爲不亡也。」",
          "subject_person_mention_id": "c-nanqishu-048-liuhui-complete:p001:m0002",
          "object_person_mention_id": "c-nanqishu-048-liuhui-complete:p001:m0019"
        }
      ],
      "status": "source_attested",
      "interpretation_note": "數位勉，殿本及南史作勔。",
      "reviewer": "Codex（AI代理）",
      "model": null,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
